| :-------------------------------- | :------- | :-------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :------------------------------------------- |
| `agent_org.job.id`                | string   | Unique identifier for an evolutionary job.                                  | `evo-job-alpha`                              |
| `agent_org.generation.number`     | int      | Current generation number.                                                  | `15`                                         |
| `agent_org.agent.id`              | string   | Unique identifier of the agent involved.                                    | `uuid-1234-abcd`                             |
| `agent_org.genome.id`             | string   | ID of the genome used by the agent.                                         | `genome-xyz-789`                             |
